<li>Kota tujuan internasional: Amsterdam, Barcelona, Basel/Mulhouse, Belgrade, Bilbao, Birmingham, Bologna, Bordeaux, Bornholm, Bratislava, Brussels, Bucharest, Budapest, Copenhagen, Edinburgh, Florence, Gdańsk, Jenewa, Gothenburg, Graz, Helsinki, Katowice, Kiev, Kraków, Linz, London, Lyon, Madrid, Manchester, Marseille, Milan, Naples, Newcastle, Nice, Oslo, Paris, Poznań, Prague, Riga, Rome, Rostov, Sarajevo, Sofia, Stavanger, Stockholm, Tallinn, Tirana, Toulouse, Turin, Vienna, Vilnius, Warsaw, Zagreb dan Zürich.</li>
</ul>
